## Missing-Chemical Impact and Preparation

Native impact projection is pending. Violet-leaf lot equivalence, Hedione HC, and Haitian vetiver remain gaps. Verify EB and the violet-leaf stock receipt before dosing. No extra ionone, musk, tincture, or Ambrettolide purchase is authorized.

## Controlled Blinded Test Plan

Compare equal-mass and equal-concentration coded LH-06 and LH-01 in balanced order at 0, 5, and 30 minutes and 2 and 4 hours. Judge L'Homme identity before green texture, silk continuity, powder drift, and liking. No physical result exists.

## Claim Ceiling

Physical liking, sensory similarity, stability, and measured headspace are `NOT TESTED`; safety and release are `NOT CLEARED`.

